{
  "description": "篡改与畸形 zip 夹具（实施计划 Review Focus 2、T1 Step 4 / 4a）。每条由 base 黄金包经 kind 指定的变换生成；resign=true 表示改完 manifest 后用测试密钥重新签名（签名与完整性都成立，只剩被测的那一处错误）。stage 是失败发生的检查阶段（决定 meta，见 README「检查顺序」）；省略时按错误码取缺省阶段。全部必须在求值之前失败。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "payload-byte-flipped",
      "base": "b-credit-limit",
      "args": [
        "run",
        "payload-byte-flipped",
        "--input",
        "-",
        "--jwks",
        "../keys/test-jwks.json"
      ],
      "stdin": "{\"applicant\":{\"activeDefaults\":0,\"creditScore\":760,\"monthlyDebt\":\"2000\",\"monthlyIncome\":\"9000\",\"requestedAmount\":\"20000\"}}",
      "expectedStdout": "{\"error\":{\"code\":\"PKG_INTEGRITY\",\"message\":\"package integrity check failed\"},\"meta\":{\"cliVersion\":\"<CLI_VERSION>\",\"coreIrSha256\":null,\"engine\":\"<ENGINE>\",\"entry\":null,\"irRecompiled\":false,\"signed\":true},\"ok\":false}\n",
      "expectedExit": 3,
      "code": "PKG_INTEGRITY"
    },
